dow rather than being it.","candidate":null,"standing":true,"ruledOutBy":null,"equivalent":true,"separatedBy":{"observable":"Nothing this archive can measure.","predicts":{"the same length":"the five ratios","a length proportional to it":"the five ratios"},"sensitivity_here":"A test on ratios cannot see a constant multiple, and the constant this run measured is 0.894 rather than one. What would separate them is where the latency sits inside the read-out, which is a place in a chain and not a quantity that leaves the unit.","margin":1,"why_not_separable":"The reading is a ratio and the difference is a constant multiple, so this is recorded as equivalent rather than left open. Refusing to choose between two readings that both reproduce is the answer and not a deferral -- and the multiple itself is published so that a reader who has a use for it is not told it was one.","run":null}}],"reproduces":null,"models":[],"charts":[],"examples":[],"extra":[],"slug":"fb-p-shifter-feedback-mode","documents":[{"id":"roland-sc-8850-owners-manual-en","title":"SC-8850 Owner's Manual","publisher":"Roland Corporation","copyright":"1999","printing":"00-7-A3-31N","language":"en","pagesRead":0,"pages":256}]}
